tice officer  with no warrant and took every gun in  the house  I don't even didn't even know what gun  was I bought for Dave for Christmas  couldn't have told you I've never loaded  a gun  you bring nine officers to the house you  surround the house how much is that  costing they didn't need to do that they  embarrassed us in the in the  neighborhood it is humiliating when  somebody comes to your door and treats  you like a criminal  it's not how we should be treating  people who are living with an illness to  the extent that society continues to  vilify the mentally ill and escape goat  them as being the primary cause of gun  violence is is a major step backward  there needs to be some better policing  of who who they're coming after  [Music]  you

